From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: mt7988a-bpi-r4-pro: add Wi-Fi EEPROM

The BPI-R4 Pro 8X schematic and the tested M06 implementation identify
one AT24C02-compatible EEPROM on the Wi-Fi I2C mux channel at address
0x51.

Describe only the 256-byte EEPROM device. Do not use it as MT7996
calibration storage, add a second EEPROM, or assume Factory data.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7988a-bananapi-bpi-r4-pro.dtsi | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7988a-bananapi-bpi-r4-pro.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt7988a-bananapi-bpi-r4-pro.dtsi
@@ -439,6 +439,14 @@
 			reg = <3>;
 			#address-cells = <1>;
 			#size-cells = <0>;
+
+			wifi_eeprom: eeprom@51 {
+				compatible = "atmel,24c02";
+				reg = <0x51>;
+				address-width = <8>;
+				pagesize = <8>;
+				size = <256>;
+			};
 		};
 	};
 };
